          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "LITTLE GADDESDEN       \tNETTLEDEN ROAD TL 01 SW   \t\t\t\t\t(East side) 2/208                                   \tMilestone opposite -                                      \t\tCromer Close -                                      \t\tII Milestone. Early C19 for 7th Earl of Bridgewater. Portland stone. A small square milestone not connected with any turnpike, with figures cut into the stone. About 15ins square and 2ft high with chamfered arrises stopped above ground level. 4 top edges chamfered and top a blunt pyramid.  Mason's  mark  E  cut  into  S  face.   Inscribed  on  W '28/MILES/TO/LONDON'. (Branch Johnson (1970)111). Listing NGR: TL0034411986"
    }
  ],
